0	section	Starting off
1	line	Captain Harlan	Greetings, adventurer. Captain Harlan, leader of the Lumbridge Guard, at your service. Is there anything I can do for you?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Do you need help with anything?
2	line	Player	Do you need help with anything?
2	line	Captain Harlan	Well, I do actually have a bounty available at the moment that you might be interested in. 1,000 coins to whoever can bring justice to some thieves that robbed the General Store.
2	select	Start the Mudfoot's Big Adventure quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Sounds like a job for me. What do you know about these thieves?
3	line	Captain Harlan	It happened in the night, so no one got a clear view, but a traveller passing through reckons he saw some of those goblins on the other side of the river playing with the stolen goods.
3	line	Player	I guess I'll start over there then.
3	line	Captain Harlan	Good luck, adventurer.
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	Sorry, but I don't think I can help with that right now.
3	line	Captain Harlan	Fair enough. Just let me know if you change your mind.
3	action	end
