0	section	Talking to Mudfoot
1	line	Mudfoot	Die, human, die!
1	action	Mudfoot hits the player for 0 damage.
1	line	Player	Er... What are you doing?
1	line	Mudfoot	Me killing you.
1	action	Mudfoot hits the player for 0 damage.
1	line	Player	You're not doing a very good job...
1	line	Mudfoot	Wrong. You dead now.
1	line	Player	Okay... And why are you killing me?
1	line	Mudfoot	Me on quest.
1	line	Player	A quest?
1	line	Mudfoot	Yes. Me going to be great goblin adventurer. Other goblins will call me Mudfoot the... good at quests.
1	line	Player	And what is this quest you're on?
1	line	Mudfoot	Me kill the nasty humans. Nasty humans rob other humans, but then they dump the stuff they rob here. Now we get blamed.
1	line	Player	Wait, so it wasn't you goblins who robbed the General Store?
1	line	Mudfoot	No. We goblins innocent. We never rob, apart from all the other times when we did, but this not those times. This time we no do it.
1	line	Mudfoot	Look, me have proof.
1	box	Mudfoot shows you a collection of items from the General Store.
1	line	Mudfoot	See. We keep things safe. No touch them at all, apart from when Damptoes try to eat chisel, but he no do that again now. Eating chisel make him throw up and die.
1	line	Player	I see... Well, perhaps I can help you with your quest. I'm actually on a quest myself to find whoever robbed the General Store. Maybe we can work together?
1	line	Mudfoot	Hmm... me not really need help. Me very good at quest...
1	line	Mudfoot	But me generous also. Maybe me let human join as sidekick. Human can learn thing or two from Mudfoot.
1	line	Player	That sounds... wonderful. Where do we begin?
1	line	Mudfoot	Other goblins see three humans who dump robbed stuff. We find all humans and make them dead. First one was man with bow. Other goblins see him go back across river. We find him there.
2	cond	If the player has a follower:
