0	section	After the battle
1	line	Mudfoot	Another nasty thief go dead!
1	line	Player	She mentioned H.A.M.
1	line	Mudfoot	Nasty human must be member of nasty group. Always calling goblins monsters. We no monsters... apart from maybe Dungface. He once kill chicken just because it lay egg on his foot.
1	line	Player	I suppose this explains why they were trying to frame you.
1	line	Mudfoot	Me impossible to frame. Rattrap try it once, but he fail. Me too wriggly.
1	line	Player	What?
1	line	Mudfoot	Humans silly anyway. They no consider powerful hero like Mudfoot! Me on quest to stop all the nasty humans.
1	line	Player	Well, on that note, just one left to go. What do you know about the last thief?
1	line	Mudfoot	Other goblins say this one great warrior, but not as great as me.
1	line	Player	Meaning they're using melee, so we need to use magic.
1	line	Mudfoot	Magic? Me try that once. They say to cast spell you wave hands, but me just wave big hammer instead. Work just as good.
1	line	Player	Are you sure?
1	line	Mudfoot	Yes. That why me stick with spear. This good for us though. Goblins say human do big religion.
1	line	Player	Big religion?
1	line	Mudfoot	He pray to his stupid god to help him. Means he protected. You do close up poke, he pray to stop close up poke. You do far away throw, he pray to stop far away throw.
1	line	Mudfoot	But he stupid. He no have good god like goblins have Big High War God. His god have short attention span and only listen to one prayer at time. If me use spear and you use fancy magic, he can't stop both.
1	line	Player	I see. Sounds like we have a plan then.
1	line	Mudfoot	Yes, best plan. You get yourself magic stick. Take one from dead magic woman, or maybe guard man help. Then we kill last thief. Other goblins see him down in graveyard.
1	line	Player	So south east of here. Shall we get going?
1	line	Mudfoot	Okay. Me behind you.
1	action	end
