2	line	Player	So, about those thieves...
2	line	Captain Harlan	Ah, yes. How goes your hunt?
2	line	Player	The first two have been dealt with. We're now moving on to the last one. Apparently, this one is a warrior, but one that uses prayers to help protect himself in battle.
2	line	Captain Harlan	Ah, well against a warrior, magic will work best, but you'll likely also need a second attack style to overcome his prayers.
2	line	Player	Yes, Mudfoot's going to use melee while I use magic.
2	line	Captain Harlan	Very good.
