1	option	All of those thieves have been dealt with.
2	line	Player	All of those thieves have been dealt with.
2	cond	If the player has Mudfoot with them:
3	line	Captain Harlan	Excellent! Did you manage to work out why they did it?
3	action	continue
2	cond	If the player does not have Mudfoot with them:
3	line	Captain Harlan	Excellent! Why don't you go and fetch your goblin friend, and then we can discuss your reward.
3	action	end
2	line	Player	It seems they were trying to stir up trouble and frame the goblins for it. At least one of them was a H.A.M. supporter, or maybe a full member.
2	line	Captain Harlan	I see... It seems H.A.M. are starting to become more problematic. That is unfortunate...
2	line	Captain Harlan	Anyway, that's one for me to worry about. Shall we get you sorted out with your reward?
2	line	Mudfoot	Yes, reward good. Me also give back stolen items. Me take good care of them. Nothing missing at all. Me check two times.
2	box	Mudfoot gives Captain Harlan the items from the General Store.
2	line	Captain Harlan	Many thanks. Now, the bounty was for 1,000 coins, so that's 500 coins each.
2	line	Mudfoot	500? But me the boss. Human just trusty sidekick. Me should get more money. Bigger money too. Boss always bigger than sidekick, so money be bigger to match.
2	line	Player	Mudfoot...
2	line	Mudfoot	Hmm... But me suppose you do good job. Me actually quite proud of sidekick. Not as proud as me am of me, but still close. One day you maybe be as good at quests as me.
2	line	Mudfoot	Okay, just this once, sidekick can have full 500.
2	box	Captain Harlan gives Mudfoot his half of the bounty.
2	line	Mudfoot	Okay, me go now. Time to find new quest. Maybe me solve big mystery this time.
2	line	Player	What kind of mystery?
2	line	Mudfoot	Me no know. That why it mystery. Bye now.
2	line	Player	See you around, Mudfoot.
2	box	Mudfoot departs.
2	cond	If the player has no inventory space:
3	line	Captain Harlan	Right then... Let's get you sorted with your half of the bounty. Alongside the coins I promised, I also have some lamps here that I think you'll find useful. I just need you to make some space for them.
3	line	Player	Okay, I'll be back shortly.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has inventory space:
3	line	Captain Harlan	Right then... Thanks for all of your help with those thieves, adventurer. Here's your half of the bounty, along with some lamps that I think you'll find useful. All the best!
3	action	end
